7-1024x681.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-15 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/681;width:-245px;height:-163px\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/iStock-1190794697-1024x681.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/iStock-1190794697-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/iStock-1190794697-768x511.jpg 768w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/iStock-1190794697-1536x1021.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/penserra.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/iStock-1190794697.jpg 1800w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<p>Our capital markets professionals, traders and sales force have extensive transactional experience in a variety of market environments.&nbsp; We serve companies in a broad range of industry sectors, including utilities, financial institutions, consumer products, industrials, media, telecommunications, technology, health care and energy.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>With a solid capital base and dependable sales and trading platforms, Penserra is ideally positioned to underwrite and distribute a comprehensive array of fixed income and equity securities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Debt Capital Markets<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Investment Grade and High Yield<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Secured and Unsecured<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fixed and Floating<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Senior, Subordinated, Convertible and Preferred<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Money Market Securities<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote alignright\"><blockquote><p>Our commitment is to deliver quality and consistent execution on every transaction.<\/p><\/blockquote><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Equity Capital Markets<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Initial Public Offerings (IPOs)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Follow-On\/ Secondary Offerings<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Corporate Share Repurchase<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Open market 10b-18 and 10b5-1 execution<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fully integrated with Penserra\u2019s experienced and reliable Equity Trading Team and technology<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Close monitoring, market updates and accurate reporting and settlement<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>Senior management is actively engaged in every transaction, regardless of client size.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"recent-transactions\">Recent Transactions<\/h3>\n\n\n<style><\/style><style>.kb-row-layout-id5552_5794e3-3f > .kt-row-column-wrap{align-content:start;}:where(.kb-row-layout-id5552_5794e3-3f > .kt-row-column-wrap) > .wp-block-kadence-column{justify-content:start;}.kb-row-layout-id5552_5794e3-3f > .kt-row-column-wrap{column-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-sm, 1rem);row-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-md, 2rem);padding-top:var(--global-kb-spacing-sm, 1.5rem);padding-bottom:var(--global-kb-spacing-sm, 1.5rem);}.kb-row-layout-id5552_5794e3-3f > .kt-row-column-wrap > div:not(.added-for-specificity){grid-column:initial;}.kb-row-layout-id5552_5794e3-3f > .kt-row-column-wrap{grid-template-columns:repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));}.kb-row-layout-id5552_5794e3-3f > .kt-row-layout-overlay{opacity:0.30;}@media all and (max-width: 1024px){.kb-row-layout-id5552_5794e3-3f > .kt-row-column-wrap{column-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-md, 2rem);row-gap:var(--global-kb-gap-md, 2rem);grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));}}@media all and (max-width: 1024px){.kb-row-layout-id5552_5794e3-3f > .kt-row-column-wrap > div:not(.added-for-specificity){grid-column:initial;}}@media all and (max-width: 767px){.kb-row-layout-id5552_5794e3-3f > .kt-row-column-wrap > div:not(.added-for-specificity){grid-column:initial;}.kb-row-layout-id5552_5794e3-3f > .kt-row-column-wrap{grid-template-columns:minmax(0, 1fr);}}<\/style><div class